                                                "example_id": "1d19d8c2-4156-45cf-90dd-7700ed3d9213",
                                                "sense_id": "38e2277e-2874-3855-a566-8f2208427f57",
                                                "text": "However, I am not prone to sensitiveness, and the following of a sense of duty, wherever it may lead, has always been a kind of fetich with me throughout my life; which may account for the honors bestowed upon me by three republics and the decorations and friendships of an old and powerful emperor and several lesser kings, in whose service my sword has been red many a time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2649e422-1699-4941-8e8e-6eb6390b9f0c",
                                                "sense_id": "38e2277e-2874-3855-a566-8f2208427f57",
                                                "text": "We have a feeling that it must be \"honest\" work, because it is hard and disagreeable, and we have made a sort of fetish of manual work."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbfd0f79-8ffa-490f-ac8e-7b8ef569d6e8",
                                                "sense_id": "38e2277e-2874-3855-a566-8f2208427f57",
                                                "text": "The most amusing was the Wastebasket Era, which combined the stacking fetish with a container fixation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "23ecdb52-1420-40a2-9a91-112435787058",
                                                "sense_id": "38e2277e-2874-3855-a566-8f2208427f57",
                                                "text": "A leading candidate for this role in the case of women has been the soap fetish.[…]Given this general cultural background the reasons for the rise of the soap fetish are not hard to find.[…]Guilt, as one of the propellers of the soap fetish, does not confine its thrust to the desire to wash dirty hands or erase the blots from the copybook."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fe19d9c-86b8-49b9-ab3c-b0926fe926be",
                                                "sense_id": "38e2277e-2874-3855-a566-8f2208427f57",
                                                "text": "A locavore (local plus the -vore of carnivore, etc.) is someone who makes a fetish of eating locally produced food."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b66b2abb-5ea4-3c50-a14b-0f9a39ffdb74",
                                        "entry_id": "cd6637ac-0a9f-384b-b2f2-bd3e57034a5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A recurrent theme of a specific thing."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "65f1debc-8b2f-41e3-9840-aabc68971f89",
                        "source_entry_id": "f2060109-d557-315c-abc2-6b16b185f3cd",
                        "source_sense_id": "bafaeace-8e10-36d8-a3b6-9f5710d3942d",
                        "source_sense_description": "kultischer Gegenstand, dem besondere Eigenschaften zugesprochen werden",
                        "target_lang_word": "fetysz",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
